{
  "about": "Conditions as the server (Liquidum::Conditions, test/models/liquidum/conditions_test.rb) and the browser (app/javascript/liquidum/conditions.js, test/javascript/conditions_test.js) work them out: both have to agree. A case's values are JSON, a {\"$date\": \"yyyy-mm-dd\"} a date (a Date in Ruby and in JavaScript); its rules, with match all unless it says any, are met or not.",
